Spec: Advise

Purpose:
  Ask the person's chosen model for one suggested post, and leave the decision to them.

Owns:
  ./advise.rs

Must:
  Run only after the suggestion key when advise is on and both api_base and model are set.
  POST {api-base}/chat/completions with the segment list and at most 24 JPEG frames per video.
  Include a frame near the start and near the end when the file has more than one scene.
  Convert HEIC photos to JPEG. Each image stays under 5 MB.
  Send Authorization: Bearer only when a key is in effect.
  Parse the reply as one post in the plan.json shape and show it in the terminal.

Must not:
  Encode video.
  Write plan.json or a post folder.
  Open a connection while advise is off.
  Run when api_base or model is empty. The suggestion key opens settings instead.

Scenario: advisor off
  Given advise is off
  When the person works through the candidate list
  Then no network connection is opened

Scenario: suggestion is not encoded
  Given advise is on and the model returns a suggested Reel
  When the person accepts the suggestion
  Then the unsaved post shows that suggestion
  And no post.mp4 is written until the person saves

Scenario: bad reply
  Given the model reply is not a post
  When the suggestion returns
  Then the error is shown
  And the unsaved post is unchanged
